    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>→</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>+</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p>The formula used here is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the answer is option A.</p>",
